    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d3">

                <pb facs="0036" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1949v01/pg6"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Additional information regarding the organization of the Department of State
                    appears in the appropriate volumes of Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, the <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Government Organization Manual</hi>, and the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Official Register of the United States</hi>. For a description of the
                    reorganization of the Department of State during 1949, see James L. McCamy, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Administration of American Foreign Affairs</hi> (New
                    York: Alfred A. Knopf, 1950), Chapter III.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
